{
  "id": "statewide-executive-parties-2026",
  "about": "Party of each non-governor statewide executive officeholder as of January 2026, and whether the general election carries party labels. Verified on 2026-10-13 against live Wikipedia pages: lieutenant governor, attorney general, secretary of state, treasurer, auditor, comptroller or controller (where listed there) and agriculture commissioner rows for the 50 states. Verified rows cite the Wikipedia source and carry no estimated flag; partisan-ballot status was taken from each page's elected-office listing. Superintendent, insurance, labor and land commissioner, mine inspector, utility and railroad commission, board, mayor, D.C. and territory rows, and the Arizona and New Jersey lieutenant governor rows, could not be checked against a live source (Ballotpedia, NASS and per-office pages failed or returned nothing) and carry an estimated note. Joint-ticket lieutenant governors are marked partisan.",
  "asOf": "2026-01",
